        "@value": "by inserting after the words \"not an authority pilot\" the words \"or an employee licensed under section 29cA (1) of a licensed operator or any person authorised by the authority to pilot vessels pursuant to section 29cs (2)\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/21/eng@/~cl_16__para_b__subpara_ii",
